18b8132d82270d1c5c6334cd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして、\n私のキャラクターのイラストをお願いできますでしょうか？\n\nよければテーマは 屋上でお願いします。\n構図やポーズ等はお任せします、ご自由に描いてください。\n\n使用用途はパソコンのデスクトップ 壁紙に使用させていただきたいですので、\n可能でありましたらイラストのサイズは 3840x2160、もしくはそれ以上のサイズでお願いします。（16：9）\n\n参考資料：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18W0l0E1exfHTTWBetT5lQPwiv6-tSncG\n\nお忙しいところ恐縮ですが、ご検討のほど宜しくお願い申し上げます。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18W0l0E1exfHTTWBetT5lQPwiv6-tSncG", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@31Shiobara/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/81a0a9fb/uploads/origins/f0abf03e-7589-45cd-9dc5-0466137325ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=dd52e2e789a2876663fff55a97f8d95e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/81a0a9fb/uploads/origins/f0abf03e-7589-45cd-9dc5-0466137325ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=dd52e2e789a2876663fff55a97f8d95e, https://si.imgix.net/81a0a9fb/uploads/origins/f0abf03e-7589-45cd-9dc5-0466137325ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=18f39fc2c140eada622f251d9fdadde4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/81a0a9fb/uploads/origins/f0abf03e-7589-45cd-9dc5-0466137325ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f0db7c75187afd3a11291ffc04be3a03 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@31Shiobara/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/10ed0954/uploads/origins/fa7ef6a4-cd8e-40bb-9a5a-a92d8e1810f5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9472a44a6f715912a2c2d7cfc70f8baf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/10ed0954/uploads/origins/fa7ef6a4-cd8e-40bb-9a5a-a92d8e1810f5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9472a44a6f715912a2c2d7cfc70f8baf, https://si.imgix.net/10ed0954/uploads/origins/fa7ef6a4-cd8e-40bb-9a5a-a92d8e1810f5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd4562ae4a47f5d6a2540f52724267b3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/10ed0954/uploads/origins/fa7ef6a4-cd8e-40bb-9a5a-a92d8e1810f5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39bac73e5daff23d2e4e5f69bdb845c1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Shiobara!\n\nI am Nia and I am a cosplayer. I love your art and I'd like to request an artwork of my mascot character.\n\nContents of the request:\nI would like to make it spring-themed as this will be for my 2-year anniversary for cosplay.\nIf you could write \"Thank you all for your continued support! (皆様、これからも応援よろしくお願いします!)\" on the image I would be happy.\n\nPurpose of Use:\nI would like to use it for SNS / streaming / personal uses.... etc\n\nPreferred delivery format:\nPSD, size 16:9\nPlease make a separate layer for the person and background, or have them transparent.\n\nCharacter\nCheck reference URL.\n\n* Please draw her a tail (same colour as her ears) if you decide to include some of the back.\n* If you want, you can do a casual outfit for her if it suits the theme better.\n\nOther\nI'll leave the details of the pose and composition to you. \n\nThank you very much!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/njkAnIi", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@31Shiobara/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d38c721c/uploads/origins/0abbbef3-3720-4bb8-9558-5e9a57937921?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6340a8cf10b9a5b470da27a1e7f3a25", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d38c721c/uploads/origins/0abbbef3-3720-4bb8-9558-5e9a57937921?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6340a8cf10b9a5b470da27a1e7f3a25, https://si.imgix.net/d38c721c/uploads/origins/0abbbef3-3720-4bb8-9558-5e9a57937921?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c591e3309262c76c7eb367cd9900d719 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d38c721c/uploads/origins/0abbbef3-3720-4bb8-9558-5e9a57937921?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0458d21cfc5ab310ceee01bb4f88213 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "しおばらさんの絵がとても好きです。私のキャラクターを描いていただけませんか？\nhttps://toyhou.se/5529134.lavi/14529490.reference\n\nキツネと人間のハーフですが、両方の世界を愛していて、両者が仲良く共存してほしいと願っています。人懐っこくて、のんびりしていて、遊び心があります。構図はお任せしますので、ここではどんな格好でも自由に描いてください。フェミニンな服もマスキュリンな服も着ます。  (または、しおばらさんが自分で作ってもいいですよ！)\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/635587136317292626/936665832996610138/unknown.png\n\nhttps://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/44803505_O14gf1nHoPuVHGD.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@31Shiobara/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a37e0d34/uploads/origins/30fd2eda-b5b4-49cc-ac4e-1423c8019984?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=342c7935ebd5937b305cd7e6a286eaf3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a37e0d34/uploads/origins/30fd2eda-b5b4-49cc-ac4e-1423c8019984?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=342c7935ebd5937b305cd7e6a286eaf3, https://si.imgix.net/a37e0d34/uploads/origins/30fd2eda-b5b4-49cc-ac4e-1423c8019984?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff44e479fdb6c92969462f35b01e7028 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a37e0d34/uploads/origins/30fd2eda-b5b4-49cc-ac4e-1423c8019984?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=93e09132712183c5be0772069b160ec7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "URLの不備があったため、再送リクエスト失礼致します。\n\n自創作キャラなのですが、尚と蒼空の2人をお願いします。  \n\n惑星擬人化で、惑星や星などがテーマになっています。構図など全てお任